<div class="content-wrapper"><section class="content-header"><h1>Edit <?= html_escape(strtoupper($type)) ?></h1></section><section class="content"><?php $this->load->view('pipeline/billing_notice'); ?><?php if($error): ?><div class="alert alert-danger"><?= html_escape($error) ?></div><?php endif; ?><?php if($type==='invoice'&&($this->db->where('InvoiceID',(int)$id)->get('PipelineOperationInvoice')->row_array()||$this->db->where('InvoiceID',(int)$id)->get('PipelineSppInvoice')->row_array())): ?><p><a class="btn btn-success" href="<?= site_url('Pipeline_documents/invoice/'.$id) ?>">Edit Pilihan Dokumen &amp; Hitung Ulang Invoice</a></p><?php endif; ?><div class="box box-primary"><div class="box-body"><p class="text-muted">Perubahan hanya diizinkan jika dokumen belum digunakan dokumen turunan atau pembayaran. Nomor dan tanggal permohonan bunker tetap mengikuti penomoran aslinya.</p><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"><?php $this->load->view('pipeline/billing_token'); ?><input type="hidden" name="RevisionHash" value="<?= hash('sha256',json_encode($r)) ?>"><div class="row"><?php foreach($fields as $key=>$meta): ?><div class="col-sm-6 form-group"><label><?= html_escape($meta[0]) ?></label><?php if($meta[1]==='textarea'): ?><textarea name="<?= $key ?>" class="form-control" maxlength="<?= $meta[2] ?>"><?= html_escape($form[$key]??'') ?></textarea><?php else: ?><input name="<?= $key ?>" class="form-control" type="<?= $meta[1] ?>" maxlength="<?= $meta[2] ?>" value="<?= html_escape($form[$key]??'') ?>" <?= $meta[1]==='number'?'step="0.001" min="0"':'' ?> <?= in_array($key,array('CompanyName','VesselName'),true)?'readonly':'' ?>><?php endif; ?></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><?php if($type==='spp'): ?><p><label><input type="checkbox" name="Confirmed" value="1" required> Saya sudah membandingkan seluruh koreksi dengan dokumen SPP.</label></p><a target="_blank" href="<?= site_url('Pipeline_spp/file/'.$id) ?>">Lihat SPP asli</a><hr><?php endif; ?><?php if(in_array($type,array('spp','ksop'),true)): ?><div class="form-group"><label>Ganti file (opsional) — JPG / PNG / PDF, maks. 15 MB</label><input type="file" name="ReplacementFile" accept=".jpg,.jpeg,.png,.pdf,image/jpeg,image/png,application/pdf" class="form-control"><small>SPP pengganti dibaca ulang oleh OCR dan wajib diperiksa kembali. File lama dipertahankan di arsip audit.</small></div><?php endif; ?><button class="btn btn-primary">Simpan Perubahan</button></form></div></div></section></div>
